    bigIdea:
      'In Releasing Your Potential and Maximizing Your Potential, Dr. Myles Munroe argued that the gifts Yahweh puts in a person are revealed only when demands are made on them, that faith and work are the two ways potential is drawn out, and that potential is given to be shared with others and passed to the next generation. His famous charge was to die empty: to spend everything Yahweh deposited in you before you leave, so that nothing He meant for others is buried with you.',
